Meta.documentation:Resource.NewResource
Meta.documentation:Constructs a new resource at run time out of port definitions and
Meta.documentation:declares it in the enclosing scope under the URI tail.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Declaration uses the var-flavor list form - the list elements flow
Meta.documentation:into the NewResource element:
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:  [[
Meta.documentation:     [ [String:Hello]>>String.concatenate:>>Resource.NewInput:String:inp1 ]
Meta.documentation:     [ [Number:5]>>Resource.NewInput:Number:num ]
Meta.documentation:  ]]>>Resource.NewResource:Tester
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Each NewInput/NewOutput element connecting to the constructed
Meta.documentation:resource registers there as a typed port (in_<Type>_<name> for
Meta.documentation:inputs, out_<Type>_<name> for outputs). Afterwards <Name>: resolves
Meta.documentation:the constructed instance: values into a matching input capture and
Meta.documentation:forward through the wired channel, values into the named port
Meta.documentation:replay through the registered input, and on go <Name>: used as a
Meta.documentation:source replays declarer-time captures.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Ports sharing a chain share the out channel; chainless ports
Meta.documentation:forward through whichever out channel is currently wired. Port
Meta.documentation:flags ride as Dawn inputs on the port URI tails
Meta.documentation:(?|all=true&|explicit=true&|group=g&|name=n); groups are stored
Meta.documentation:only in v1 - see the ROADMAP socket-pin proposal.
Meta.documentation:@see Resource.NewInput
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20NewResource%3A%3CName%3E%20%20constructs%20a%20new%20resource%20at%20run%20time%20out%20of%20port%0A%2F%2F%20definitions%20and%20declares%20it%20in%20the%20enclosing%20scope%20under%20%3CName%3E.%20The%0A%2F%2F%20declaration%20line%20is%20the%20var-flavor%20list%20form%3A%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%5B%5B%20%5B%3Cdeclarer-time%20value%20chains%3E%20%3E%3E%20Resource.NewInput%3A%3CType%3E%3A%3Cname%3E%5D%20%5D%20%5D%20%3E%3E%20Resource.NewResource%3A%3CName%3E%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20Port%20configuration%20rides%20as%20Dawn%20inputs%20on%20the%20port%20URI%20tails%0A%2F%2F%20(%3F%7Call%3Dtrue%2C%20%3F%7Cexplicit%3Dtrue%2C%20%3F%7Cgroup%3D%3Cg%3E%2C%20%3F%7Cname%3D%3Cn%3E%3B%20the%20leading%20%7C%0A%2F%2F%20marks%20an%20assigned%20input)%20arriving%20at%20the%20port's%20input%20functions%20-%0A%2F%2F%20names%20stay%20clean%2C%20the%20_%24-marker%20mangling%20of%20the%20runtime%20port%20keys%0A%2F%2F%20happens%20inside.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20Each%20NewInput%2FNewOutput%20element%20connecting%20to%20the%20constructed%20resource%0A%2F%2F%20registers%20there%20as%20a%20typed%20port%3B%20afterwards%20%3CName%3E%3A%20resolves%20the%0A%2F%2F%20constructed%20instance%2C%20values%20into%20the%20typed%20inputs%20capture%20and%20forward%0A%2F%2F%20through%20its%20wired%20downstream%20channels.%0Afunction%20NewResource()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%20%22NewResource%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20NewResourceProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20typeChainOf(type)%0A%7B%0A%09return%20String(type%20%7C%7C%20%22%22).split(%22_%22).filter(v%20%3D%3E%20v%20!%3D%3D%20%22%22)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20portOutKey(def)%0A%7B%0A%09let%20chain%20%3D%20typeChainOf(def.type)%3B%0A%09return%20%22out_%22%20%2B%20(chain%5B0%5D%20%7C%7C%20%22Data%22)%20%2B%20%22_default%22%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20buildPortKey(def)%0A%7B%0A%09let%20chain%20%3D%20typeChainOf(def.type)%3B%0A%09let%20markers%20%3D%20%22%22%3B%0A%09if%20(def.all)%20markers%20%2B%3D%20%22_%24all%22%3B%0A%09if%20(def.explicit)%20markers%20%2B%3D%20%22_%24explicit%22%3B%0A%09if%20(def.group)%20markers%20%2B%3D%20%22_%24group_%22%20%2B%20def.group%3B%0A%09return%20def.dir%20%2B%20%22_%22%20%2B%20(chain.join(%22_%22)%20%2B%20(chain.length%20%3F%20%22_%22%20%3A%20%22%22)%20%2B%20def.name)%20%2B%20markers%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20NewResourceProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2C%20resource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09let%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20a%20constructed%20resource%20dereferences%20to%20a%20per-use%20processor%20clone%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20sharing%20the%20same%20resource%20(reference%20semantics%2C%20like%20var)%0A%09%09if%20(resource.newResourceName)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09return%20Object.assign(%7B%7D%2C%20this)%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09let%20tail%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value)%20%7C%7C%20%22%22%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20tail%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(tail)%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%7D%0A%09%09let%20bare%20%3D%20tail.split(%22%3F%22)%5B0%5D.split(%22%23%22)%5B0%5D%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!bare)%0A%09%09%09bare%20%3D%20%22NewResource%22%3B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09newObject.name%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20bare%3B%0A%09%09newObject.newResourceName%20%3D%20bare%3B%0A%09%09newObject.introduced%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09%09newObject.inputDefs%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09newObject.outputDefs%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09let%20proc%20%3D%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20cache%20the%20constructing%20instance%20as%20the%20resource's%20default%3A%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20later%20reference%20lookups%20(%3CName%3E%3A)%20reach%20the%20tree%20through%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20default_processor()%20and%20dereference%20on%20it%2C%20so%20the%20instance%20that%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20gathered%20the%20port%20registrations%20stays%20the%20shared%20one%0A%09%09newObject.default_processor_instance%20%3D%20proc%3B%0A%09%09return%20proc%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20called%20by%20a%20NewInput%20port%20processor%20when%20it%20connects%20here%0A%09this.registerInputPort%20%3D%20function(portProcessor)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20portRes%20%3D%20portProcessor.get_resource%20%3F%20portProcessor.get_resource()%20%3A%20null%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!portRes%20%7C%7C%20!portRes.name)%20return%3B%0A%09%09let%20name%20%3D%20String(portRes.name)%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20ix%20%3D%200%3B%20ix%20%3C%20resource.inputDefs.length%3B%20ix%2B%2B)%0A%09%09%09if%20(resource.inputDefs%5Bix%5D.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20name)%0A%09%09%09%09return%3B%0A%09%09let%20def%20%3D%20%7B%0A%09%09%09dir%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20%22in%22%2C%0A%09%09%09name%3A%20%20%20%20%20name%2C%0A%09%09%09type%3A%20%20%20%20%20String(portRes.portType%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%2C%0A%09%09%09all%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20!!portRes.all%2C%0A%09%09%09explicit%3A%20!!portRes.explicit%2C%0A%09%09%09group%3A%20%20%20%20String(portRes.group%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%2C%0A%09%09%09element%3A%20%20portProcessor%0A%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%09def.key%20%3D%20buildPortKey(def)%3B%0A%09%09resource.inputDefs.push(def)%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20incoming%20calls%20replay%20into%20the%20port's%20capture%0A%09%09this%5Bdef.key%5D%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20el%20%3D%20def.element%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(el%20%26%26%20el.in_default_%24all)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20el.in_default_%24all(input)%3B%0A%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20typed%20input%20ports%20seed%20a%20matching%20out%20channel%3B%20chainless%20ports%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20forward%20through%20whichever%20channel%20is%20wired%20downstream%0A%09%09if%20(def.type)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20outKey%20%3D%20portOutKey(def)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(typeof%20this%5BoutKey%5D%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22undefined%22%20%26%26%20this%5BoutKey%5D%20!%3D%3D%20null)%0A%09%09%09%09this%5BoutKey%5D%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20the%20port%20forwards%20captures%20through%20its%20own%20reference%0A%09%09portProcessor.seedRef%20%3D%20%7B%20proc%3A%20this%2C%20key%3A%20def.type%20%3F%20portOutKey(def)%20%3A%20null%20%7D%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20called%20by%20a%20NewOutput%20port%20processor%20when%20it%20connects%20here%0A%09this.registerOutputPort%20%3D%20function(portProcessor)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20portRes%20%3D%20portProcessor.get_resource%20%3F%20portProcessor.get_resource()%20%3A%20null%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!portRes%20%7C%7C%20!portRes.name)%20return%3B%0A%09%09let%20name%20%3D%20String(portRes.name)%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20ix%20%3D%200%3B%20ix%20%3C%20resource.outputDefs.length%3B%20ix%2B%2B)%0A%09%09%09if%20(resource.outputDefs%5Bix%5D.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20name)%0A%09%09%09%09return%3B%0A%09%09let%20def%20%3D%20%7B%0A%09%09%09dir%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20%22out%22%2C%0A%09%09%09name%3A%20%20%20%20%20name%2C%0A%09%09%09type%3A%20%20%20%20%20String(portRes.portType%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%2C%0A%09%09%09all%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20!!portRes.all%2C%0A%09%09%09explicit%3A%20!!portRes.explicit%2C%0A%09%09%09group%3A%20%20%20%20String(portRes.group%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%2C%0A%09%09%09element%3A%20%20portProcessor%0A%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%09def.key%20%3D%20buildPortKey(def)%3B%0A%09%09resource.outputDefs.push(def)%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20the%20output%20channel%20the%20constructed%20resource%20emits%20through%0A%09%09this%5Bdef.key%5D%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09portProcessor.seedRef%20%3D%20%7B%20proc%3A%20this%2C%20key%3A%20def.key%20%7D%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20re-register%20a%20port%20whose%20flags%20or%20name%20were%20set%20through%20its%20Dawn%0A%09%2F%2F%20inputs%20(in_Boolean_all%20etc.)%20after%20it%20first%20connected%3A%20refresh%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20def%20and%20rewrite%20the%20registered%20port%20key%0A%09this.refreshPortRegistration%20%3D%20function(portProcessor)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20portRes%20%3D%20portProcessor.get_resource%20%3F%20portProcessor.get_resource()%20%3A%20null%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!portRes)%20return%3B%0A%09%09let%20defs%20%3D%20resource.inputDefs.concat(resource.outputDefs)%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20ix%20%3D%200%3B%20ix%20%3C%20defs.length%3B%20ix%2B%2B)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20d%20%3D%20defs%5Bix%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(d.element%20!%3D%3D%20portProcessor)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20oldKey%20%3D%20d.key%3B%0A%09%09%09d.all%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20!!portRes.all%3B%0A%09%09%09d.explicit%20%3D%20!!portRes.explicit%3B%0A%09%09%09d.group%20%20%20%20%3D%20String(portRes.group%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(portRes.name)%20d.name%20%3D%20String(portRes.name)%3B%0A%09%09%09d.key%20%3D%20buildPortKey(d)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(d.key%20!%3D%3D%20oldKey)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09delete%20this%5BoldKey%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(d.dir%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22in%22)%0A%09%09%09%09%09this%5Bd.key%5D%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%09%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09%09%09let%20el%20%3D%20d.element%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09%09if%20(el%20%26%26%20el.in_default_%24all)%0A%09%09%09%09%09%09%09return%20el.in_default_%24all(input)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%09%09%09else%0A%09%09%09%09%09this%5Bd.key%5D%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20the%20wired%20instance%20keeps%20its%20binding%3A%20only%20the%20key%20follows%20the%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20refreshed%20def%2C%20the%20proc%20stays%20whatever%20the%20connect%20re-pointed%0A%09%09%09let%20seedRef%20%3D%20portProcessor.seedRef%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20freshKey%20%3D%20d.dir%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22in%22%20%3F%20(d.type%20%3F%20portOutKey(d)%20%3A%20null)%20%3A%20d.key%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(!seedRef)%0A%09%09%09%09portProcessor.seedRef%20%3D%20%7B%20proc%3A%20this%2C%20key%3A%20freshKey%20%7D%3B%0A%09%09%09else%0A%09%09%09%09seedRef.key%20%3D%20freshKey%3B%0A%09%09%09break%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20Flow%2FList%20scope%20hook%3A%20mark%20the%20resource%20ready%20for%20name%20lookup%0A%09this.introduceNewResource%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.introduced)%0A%09%09%09return%3B%0A%09%09resource.introduced%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09return%20this%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20source%20direction%3A%20replay%20retained%20declarer-time%20captures%20downstream%0A%09this.in_go%20%3D%20async%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20defs%20%3D%20resource.inputDefs%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20ix%20%3D%200%3B%20ix%20%3C%20defs.length%3B%20ix%2B%2B)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20d%20%3D%20defs%5Bix%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(d.replayed%20%7C%7C%20!d.type)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20el%20%3D%20d.element%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20captured%20%3D%20el%20%26%26%20el.resource%20%3F%20el.resource.captured%20%3A%20undefined%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(captured%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%7C%7C%20!el.seedRef%20%7C%7C%20!el.seedRef.proc)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20proc%20%3D%20el.seedRef.proc%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20fn%20%3D%20proc%5Bel.seedRef.key%20%7C%7C%20portOutKey(d)%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(typeof%20fn%20!%3D%3D%20%22function%22)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09d.replayed%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20r%20%3D%20fn(captured)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(r)%20%7B%20if%20(r.promise)%20await%20r.promise()%3B%20else%20await%20r%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20keep%20every%20port's%20forward%20reference%20pointing%20at%20whichever%20instance%20of%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20constructed%20resource%20is%20currently%20wired%20downstream%0A%09this.previousConnect%20%3D%20this.connect%3B%0A%09this.connect%20%3D%20function(to)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20reference%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09let%20r%20%3D%20reference.previousConnect(to)%3B%0A%09%09let%20defs%20%3D%20resource.inputDefs.concat(resource.outputDefs)%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20ix%20%3D%200%3B%20ix%20%3C%20defs.length%3B%20ix%2B%2B)%0A%09%09%09if%20(defs%5Bix%5D.element%20%26%26%20defs%5Bix%5D.element.seedRef)%0A%09%09%09%09defs%5Bix%5D.element.seedRef.proc%20%3D%20reference%3B%0A%09%09return%20r%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0ANewResource.Processor%20%3D%20NewResourceProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%20%3D%20NewResource%3B%0A]>>NewResource:Resource.NewResource
